-**Inputs:** Origin point $\mathbf{o}$ (3D vector), Direction vector $\mathbf{d}$ (3D vector), and optionally a parameter range $[t_{min}, t_{max}]$.
-**Outputs:** A ray object capable of evaluating points at parameter $t$.
